{"sourceUrl":"https://yjs.cd120.com/contents/410/7581.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:19:44.849691+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://yjs.cd120.com/contents/410/7581.html","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span>为促进全国各高校临床医学优秀大学生的互动与交流，培养大学生对临床工作和科学研究的兴趣，并为优秀本科生提供了解我院临床、科研环境和与专家、学者交流的机会。我院将于</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><strong><span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>3</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span><span>--</span></span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span><span>5</span></span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><span><span>举办</span><span>“</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年华西临床医学院优秀大学生暑期夏令营</span><span>”。夏令营期间将进行一系列线下活动，如学院宣传及学科介绍、专家讲坛、学生与导师交流、参观医</span></span><span>院等。现面向全国高校招收营员</span><strong><span><span>5</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>00</span><span>余名</span></span></strong><span>，欢</span><span>迎对临床医学、护理、医学技术、中西医等学科有浓厚兴趣的优秀学子踊跃报名，了解四川大学华西临床医学院的过去、现在及未来。</span></p><p><strong><span>一、举办时间：</span></strong><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>日</span><span>—</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span>日</span></p><p><strong><span>二、招生规模与要求</span></strong></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>、</span></span><span>招生人数：</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>00</span><span>余人；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>、</span></span><span>申请条件：</span></p><p><span><span>(1) </span></span><span>全</span><span>国各高校临床医学</span><span>、护理学、医学技术等医学相关</span><span><span>学科的</span>20</span><span>2</span><span>7</span><span>届本科毕业生，重点</span><span><span>考虑</span><span>“双一流”建设高校的优秀学生；</span></span></p><p><span><span>(</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>) </span><span>对从事临床</span></span><span>医学等医学相关学科的</span><span>学术研究具有浓厚兴趣，具有一定创新能力和潜能；</span></p><p><span><span>(</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>) </span><span>全国大学外语四级水平考试成绩优良（</span><span>480</span><span>分以上），或全国大学外语六级水平成绩合格（</span><span>425</span><span>分以上），或</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>、</span><span>GRE</span><span>等考试成绩优秀者。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>三</span></strong><strong><span>、申请办法及时间</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>1、报名</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>报名时间：</span></strong><span>2026年6月9日-6月17日</span></p><p><strong><span>报名</span></strong><strong><span>方式：</span></strong><span>四川大学研究生招生信息网夏令营网</span><span>报平台</span><span>（</span><span><span>以下简称</span><span>“学校报名网站”</span></span><span>）</span><span><span>：</span><a href=\"https://yz.scu.edu.cn/xly\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://yz.scu.edu.cn/xly</span></a><span>，</span></span><span>请</span><span>只填报</span><strong><span>一个</span></strong><span>意向专业，</span><span>报名成功后生成报名号及</span><span>申请表</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>2、</span></strong><strong><span>材料提交</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>材料提交时间：</span></strong><span>2026年6月10日-6月22日上午11:00（本人在学校报名网站成功报名1个工作日后，方可登录下方网址提交材料）</span></p><p><span>注：为避免截止日期当天系统卡顿，请大家务必提前完成报名及材料上传工作</span></p><p><strong><span>材料提交方式：</span></strong><span>华西临床医学院夏令营服务系统：</span><a href=\"https://stu.wchscu.cn/gsapp/sys/xlyxsdappwchscu/login.do\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://stu.wchscu.cn/gsapp/sys/xlyxsdappwchscu/login.do</span></span></a></p><p><span>账号：报名号（学校报名网站生成）</span></p><p><span><span>密码：身份证号后</span><span>6</span><span>位（若包含字母请输入大写）</span></span></p><p><strong><span>材料清单：</span></strong></p><p><span>①</span><span>申请表（报名成功后由</span><span>学校报名网站</span><span>自动生成，下载后经所在单位推荐盖章后再上传）；</span></p><p><span>②</span><span>本科成绩单和专业排名证明</span><span>（</span><span><span>附件</span><span>1仅供参考</span></span><span>，材料均</span><span>需加盖所在学院或学校教务处公章）；</span></p><p><span>③</span><span>相关英语成绩、荣誉、比赛竞赛获奖证书复印件、学术成果复印件等。</span></p><p><span>注：</span><span>未提供申请表或申请</span><span>表未盖章的材料评议不予评分</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>3、</span></strong><strong><span>营员名单确定：</span></strong><span>我院将组织各学科专家对申请材料进行集体评议打分，根据评议成绩由高到低，按照二级学科(内外科等部分学科涉及三级学科)依次排序确定营员名单。</span></p><p><span><span>相关工作预计于</span><span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>3</span><span>日左右结束，最终营员名单将在华西临床医学院研究生部的主页上公布，并以短信或电子邮件形式通知本人，届时未接到通知的同学皆为未入选者，不另行通知。</span></p><p><strong><span>四</span></strong><strong><span>、夏令营初步安排</span></strong></p><p><span>初步方案如下，具体日程安排请关注后续通知。</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>日期</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>时间</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>7月</span><span>13</span><span>日</span></p></td><td><p><span>下午</span></p></td><td><p><span>报到、</span><span>政策</span><span>宣讲</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>7月</span><span>14</span><span>日</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>上午</span></p></td><td><p><span>开营仪式</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>参观医院（院史馆、技能中心）</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>7月</span><span>14</span><span>日</span></p></td><td><p><span>下午</span></p></td><td><span>学科介绍、科室参观、青年医师座谈</span><span>、</span><span>导师见面与交流</span></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>7月1</span><span>5</span><span>日</span></p></td><td><p><span>上午</span></p></td><td><p><span>学科介绍、科室参观、青年医师座谈</span><span>、</span><span>导师见面与交流</span></p><p><span>参观川大博物馆、</span><span>前沿医学中心</span><span>，离营</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong><span><span>六、注意事项</span>     </span></strong><span>  </span></p><p><span>1、</span><span>营员前来参加夏令营活动，</span><span><span>需做好自身安全防护工作。</span></span><span>且告知所在学校和父母，在征得同意后注意出行安全。</span><span><span>如因个人原因违反四川大学相关管理规定及营员手册要求而发生意外情况，相关责任需由本人自行承担</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>2、营员必须遵守</span><span><span>四川大学的相关规定，按照相应的安排参加各项活动，擅自不参加活动者，举办方将不提供相关住宿及后续补助。</span></span></p><p><span>3、营员（非成都本地高校）统一由我院安排住宿，费用由我院承担。</span></p><p><span>4、</span><span>请报名时正确填写所有信息，勿重复填写！请确保填报信息准确无误，若有虚假，一经查实将取消报名资格！若录取则取消录取资格！</span></p><p><span>5</span><span>、</span><span><span>本次营员若于本年度</span><span>9</span><span>月参加我</span></span><span><span>院接收推免面试，并最终成功推免至我院，将报销</span><span>9</span><span>月推免面试期间学校所在城市至成都的</span></span><strong><span><span>往返</span></span></strong><span><span>火车票价。</span></span></p><p><span><span>报销标准参照学校相关规定执行（火车硬卧或高铁动车二等座标准，飞机票不予报销），金额不超过</span><span>1000元/人，需报销者请妥善保管票据及支付记录截图（截图金额需与本人票价一致，切勿几人合并支付，以免报销失败）。相应票据收集通知预计10月发布。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>七、联系方式</span>  </span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>QQ</span><span>群：</span><span>702893094</span></span></strong><span>（加群密码</span><span>hxlcyxy</span><span>，欢迎入群咨询，请意向学生</span><strong><span>本人</span></strong><span>入群）</span></p><p><span><span>028-85421812</span><span>（张老师、仝老师）</span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://yjs.cd120.com/upload/files/2026/6/57e9bd070cbdfa41.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"附件1：成绩排名证明模板2027.docx\">附件1：成绩排名证明模板2027.docx</a></p><p><a href=\"https://yjs.cd120.com/upload/files/2026/6/7c9c39e17734fad5.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"附件2：四川大学华西临床医学院2027年招生专业介绍.pdf\">附件2：四川大学华西临床医学院2027年招生专业介绍.pdf</a></p><p><a href=\"https://yjs.cd120.com/upload/files/2026/6/e1d3785683124683.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"附件3：夏令营相关系统考生操作手册.pdf\">附件3：夏令营相关系统考生操作手册.pdf</a></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span><br/></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>华西临床医学院研究生部</span> </span></p><p><span>      <span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span><span>9</span></span><span>日</span></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"d22c3bd364ea304e2ca202c9a64d518dc29317b8c8cfd64a1a6d0e895ae1c3d4","textLength":1869,"sourceSha256":"14226971bbb9cbc8be4ae483ae378a203c0a2e178d9bb4f1e1dd482fe3476707","selector":".m3artEditor","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-873ba5e2c4debca7e430","title":"2026年四川大学华西临床医学院关于举办2026年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:19:44.849691+00:00"}
